\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces How the anomaly filter and Cautious strategy operate over time: normal motion produces gentle signal changes bounded by $\Delta I_{\max }$. When the attacker switches on, the vertical jump triggers $\mathcal  {A}_{\text  {spike}}$, freezing the robot and locking its memory until the deactivation drop $\mathcal  {A}_{\text  {drop}}$ is followed by $N_{\text  {confirm}}=3$ clean steps. \textbf  {[Watch live simulation animation: \href  {run:anomaly_filter_anim.gif}{Click to open \texttt  {anomaly\_filter\_anim.gif}} or view \href  {run:accessible_paper_online_en.html}{the Online HTML Edition}]}}}{4}{figure.caption.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:anomaly_filter}{{2}{4}{How the anomaly filter and Cautious strategy operate over time: normal motion produces gentle signal changes bounded by $\Delta I_{\max }$. When the attacker switches on, the vertical jump triggers $\mathcal {A}_{\text {spike}}$, freezing the robot and locking its memory until the deactivation drop $\mathcal {A}_{\text {drop}}$ is followed by $N_{\text {confirm}}=3$ clean steps. \textbf {[Watch live simulation animation: \href {run:anomaly_filter_anim.gif}{Click to open \texttt {anomaly\_filter\_anim.gif}} or view \href {run:accessible_paper_online_en.html}{the Online HTML Edition}]}}{figure.caption.3}{}}
