\newlabel{fig:trap}{{6}{7}{A real double-failure run from our simulation (RunID 457): \textbf {Naive (cyan)} is threshold-poisoned ($i_H = 1.230$) on the central L-obstacle; \textbf {Inertial (green)} is caught in a 40-step resonant loop on the upper-right rectangle; \textbf {Cautious (orange)} pauses during bursts and reaches the target (red star) in $137$ steps. \textbf {[Watch the step-by-step animated replay: \href {run:simulation_trap_anim.gif}{Click to open \texttt {simulation\_trap\_anim.gif}} or open \href {run:accessible_paper_online_en.html}{the Online HTML Edition}]}}{figure.caption.7}{}}
